    <p>For most individual investors, gains on crypto are taxed under the <strong>flat tax (PFU, "prélèvement forfaitaire unique")</strong> at <strong>30%</strong> (12.8% income tax plus 17.2% social contributions), applied when you cash out to euros. Frequent or professional trading can be treated differently. Log every realized gain — our <a href="/#pnl">PnL calculator</a> gives the exact number per trade — and confirm your status with a French tax advisor.</p>
