    <p>Whatever exchange you choose, two numbers decide whether you survive: your <a href="/blog/how-to-avoid-liquidation/">liquidation price</a> and your <a href="/blog/best-leverage-for-beginners/">leverage</a>. Most new traders use far too much leverage and get liquidated on normal volatility. Start at 3–5x, set a stop, and treat the calculators as part of your pre-trade routine. Italy is part of <a href="/blog/crypto-futures-europe/">crypto futures across the EU</a>.</p>
